        "procedure": "A methanol solution of Dy(OAc)3 was added to a chloroform solution of a mixture of 1,2,4-H6L^r and 1,1,4-H6L^r. The mixture was stirred at room temperature for 12 h, then concentrated to one-third of its volume. Slow evaporation of the concentrated solution yielded single crystals of 1·CH3OH suitable for X-ray diffraction. The crystals were filtered and dried under vacuum. The same complex is isolated at a 1:1 ligand:dysprosium salt molar ratio.",
